{"channelId":"UCq4-M7V2hf5DMFH575-BDgw","row":["University of Hull - Science and Engineering",1180,"Welcome to the Faculty of Science and Engineering at the University of Hull – home of inspirational breakthroughs, world-leading research and a vibrant scientific community.\n\nOur students study in state-of-the-art, industry-standard facilities such as the biomedical research facility opened in July 2013 in the new Allam Building.\n\nWhat’s more, our students are taught by some of the people behind truly jaw-dropping scientific innovations, from the liquid crystal display (LCD) breakthrough that changed the way we view the world, to the bone density scanner that detects early-onset osteoporosis and is now used in hospitals the world over.\n\nFor more information about our research or studying with us, please visit http://www.hull.ac.uk/science","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCq4-M7V2hf5DMFH575-BDgw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCq4-M7V2hf5DMFH575-BDgw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:32.774Z","channelId":"UCq4-M7V2hf5DMFH575-BDgw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"03d09c1e8deda2e4812ed3d4b09e6900c5189e74e034b716a1d0125ec464ba69","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"8c9fdd88b585cf5c6aecafac319ad4a6915e48ed508ab151e784f9901f201000"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCq4-M7V2hf5DMFH575-BDgw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":1180,"raw":"1.18K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCq4-M7V2hf5DMFH575-BDgw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:32.774Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"physical therapist","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed","role":"undetermined","flags":["当前仅有相关内容或名称线索，尚无匹配的本人专业简介；不列入职业联系优选"],"sourceUrls":[]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review",